[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12068.15, "timestamp": "03:21:08", "text": "什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12075.349, "timestamp": "03:21:15", "text": "[音樂] 伙計，這更難"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12078.389, "timestamp": "03:21:18", "text": "。比我想像的要難。  他們死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12099.51, "timestamp": "03:21:39", "text": "哦，他其實正在康復。  抓到他了。買了一個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12101.99, "timestamp": "03:21:41", "text": "那邊有個狙擊手。  那條br，那條br，那條br總有一天"}]